<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Wyle Electronics raised.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Wyle Electronics raised.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said it upgraded Wyle Electronics to outperform from neutral.</p>
<p>-- The stock rose 1-1/4 to 38-3/4 in late morning exchange trading.</p>
